docs {
  # Update Test Run

  Updates a test run's fields and optionally replaces case assignments. All fields are
  optional. Requires `test_run:update` permission and Contributor (or higher) role.

  - `200 OK` — updated test run
  - `403 Forbidden` — missing permission or Viewer role
  - `404 Not Found` — not found or soft-deleted
  - `409 Conflict` — duplicate summary
  - `422 Unprocessable Entity` — validation error
}
